  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core funding to the NGO group and Crin child rights network. The network is actively working towards the UN human rights system and specifically with the child rights committe. The network devlops capacity among national child rights organisations around the use of the UN system for human rights.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ramst&#xF6;d till n&#xE4;tverket NGO group och CRIN som arbetar f&#xF6;r att fr&#xE4;mja barns r&#xE4;ttigheter. N&#xE4;tverket arbetar aktivt mot FN systemet f&#xF6;r m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter, specifict med &#xF6;vervakningskommitt&#xE9;n f&#xF6;r barn konventionen. N&#xE4;tverket verkar f&#xF6;r att &#xF6;ka kompetensen hos barnr&#xE4;ttsorganisationer i f&#xE4;lt.</narrative>
  </description>
